# PlayMint Local Configuration Template
# Copy this file to '.env' in the same directory and paste your API key below.
# (Note: Keys prefixed with VITE_ are compiled client-side in Vite applications)

# Gemini API Key — required for AI asset generation (must be a BILLED key: the
# Gemini API free tier serves 0 images/min on every image model since Dec 2025).
# Get your key from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Without it the app still works, but every game uses the built-in theme artwork.
# You can also enter the key in the app UI (top-right on the start screen).
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ── Server asset cache (Vercel Blob) — OPTIONAL ─────────────────────────────
# On the deployed site NO client variable is needed: the browser discovers the
# store's public base URL from GET /api/games/upload (derived server-side from
# the token). This VITE_ var is only a local-dev override for plain `npm run
# dev`, which has no /api — set it to the store's public base URL (a PUBLIC
# value, it appears in every asset URL) if you want cached-art reads locally.
#VITE_BLOB_BASE_URL=https://<store-id>.public.blob.vercel-storage.com

# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN is the WRITE secret for the store. It is used ONLY by
# the serverless upload endpoint (api/games/upload.js). On Vercel it is injected
# automatically by the connected store; locally it is needed only for
# `vercel dev`. NEVER prefix it with VITE_ — that would compile the secret into
# the public client bundle.
#BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=<write token from the store settings — never commit it>

# --- Accounts (Supabase Auth) — OPTIONAL ------------------------------------
# Without BOTH values the app runs exactly as before accounts existed (no
# sign-in UI at all). The project lives in the CLIENT's Supabase account.
# Use ONLY the public anon / publishable key here: VITE_ values are compiled
# into the public bundle. The service-role / secret key must NEVER be
# VITE_-prefixed and never belongs in this file.
# Deploys go straight to Production from `main`. The code is safe to ship BEFORE
# these are set (no auth UI without them); add them in Vercel → Production and
# REDEPLOY (VITE_ values are build-time) once the Supabase project is ready.
#VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
#VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_public_anon_key_here
